      "activeLtsUntil": "2026-10-20",
      "note": "22 (Jod) entered maintenance 2025-10-21, EOL 2027-04-30. Floor is 22.22.2 because npm 12 requires it. Node 25 is NOT viable - npm 12 engines exclude it. Node 26 becomes LTS 2026-10-28; plan the next hop then."
    },
    "python": {
      "floor": "3.12",
      "target": "3.14.7",
      "eol": "2030-10-31"
